{"id":1020304,"name":"데렌·심문 IV","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"데렌·심문 IV","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1020304]}],"trial":{"trial_id":20304,"stage":"4단계","unlock_time":"2023-04-11 14:00:00","diary1":"당신은 데렌을 데리고 한 공장에 왔다. 당신은 데렌이 남긴 수첩을 연구했고 이 공장의 주인과 그 영화가 밀접한 관계가 있다는 것을 알게 됐다.","diary2":"현실을 받아들인다고 해서 그것을 운명으로 받아들이는 것은 아니다. 사람들은 살면서 항상 꿈을 구축하고 꿈이 깨지는 것을 경험하지만, 어떤 이들은 맨발로 파편 위에서 춤을 추며 마지막 남은 꿈의 한 줄기 빛을 잡으려고 한다.\n　　이런 사람들이 '미치광이'라 불리는 것은 피할 수 없는 숙명이지만… 그래도 나쁠 건 없지 않은가?","evidence":[{"ID":260333,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260334,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":3,"dialogue_id":120304003,"next":[4]},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120304023,"next":null},